<title>BELGIUM: Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.92 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.92 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg statistics agency</p>
<p>Statec released the following data on inflation -</p>
<p>    LUXEMBOURG CONSUMER PRICES *  Oct	 Sept	Oct 1995</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)	  117.39    116.86	 n/a</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (in pct)	 0.45%     0.31%	 n/a</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (in pct)	   1.92%     1.49%	 n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - * prices as measured on the first of the following month.</p>
<p>Statec said the rise was mainly due to a rise in domestic heating oil, petrol, diesel and fresh cut flowers.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
